```css
/* E4 plan additions: milestone chips, the lever ladder, definitions */

.cp-plan__chips {
  list-style: none;
  margin: var(--rp-s4) 0 0;
  padding: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--rp-s2);
}

.cp-plan__chip {
  flex: 1 1 9rem;
  min-width: 0;
  display: grid;
  gap: 3px;
  align-content: start;
  padding: var(--rp-s2) var(--rp-s3);
  background: var(--cp-inset);
  border: 1px solid var(--cp-rule);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--cp-rule);
  border-radius: var(--cp-radius);
}

.cp-plan__chip-label {
  font-family: var(--rp-font-utility);
  font-size: 0.625rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--cp-ink-faint);
}

.cp-plan__chip-amount {
  font-family: var(--rp-font-display);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  font-size: 1.0625rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--cp-ink);
}

.cp-plan__chip-reach {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: var(--cp-ink-dim);
}

.cp-plan__chip-badge {
  justify-self: start;
  font-family: var(--rp-font-utility);
  font-size: 0.5625rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.cp-plan__chip-goal {
  border-color: var(--rp-verified);
  border-left-color: var(--rp-verified);
  background: var(--rp-verified-ghost);
}

.cp-plan__chip-goal .cp-plan__chip-badge {
  color: var(--rp-verified);
}

.cp-plan__chip-stretch {
  border-color: var(--rp-money);
  border-left-color: var(--rp-money);
  background: var(--rp-money-ghost);
}

.cp-plan__chip-stretch .cp-plan__chip-badge {
  color: var(--rp-money);
}
```

Wait — border: 1px solid var(--cp-rule) then border-left: 3px solid var(--cp-rule) — order matters: declare border first then border-left ✓.

Hmm — for goal chip: `border-color: var(--rp-verified)` makes ALL borders teal (1px) +3px left — maybe too loud? The backup block uses `border-left: 3px solid + ghost bg` with default other borders (none). For chips: keep1px rule border +3px accent left + ghost bg. So:

```css
.cp-plan__chip-goal {
  border-left-color: var(--rp-verified);
  background: var(--rp-verified-ghost);
}
```

